/*!
\page page_strichcluster StRichCluster

\brief \ref page_strichcluster "StRichCluster" — group of adjacent RICH pads formed during hit reconstruction.

\section strichcluster_overview Overview
StRichCluster collects contiguous RICH pad pixels whose signals are merged
during the clustering step of hit reconstruction. The resulting cluster is
the parent of one or more \ref page_strichhit "StRichHit" objects representing
individual Cherenkov photon impact points. Multiple local maxima within a
single cluster indicate overlapping photon hits on adjacent pads.

\section strichcluster_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StRichCluster
\endcode

\section strichcluster_members Data Members
| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| Int_t | mNumberOfPads | Number of pads in the cluster |
| Int_t | mNumberOfLocalMax | Number of local amplitude maxima (sub-peaks) |
| Int_t | mFirstPad | Index of the first pad in the pixel array |
| Float_t | mMinimumAmplitudeOfLocalMax | Lowest amplitude threshold for local-maximum identification |
| Float_t | mAmplitudeSum | Sum of all pad ADC values |
| Float_t | mAmplitude2Sum | Sum of squares of all pad ADC values |
| Float_t | mRms2 | Square RMS of pad amplitudes |

\section strichcluster_methods Key Methods
| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| int numberOfPads() const | Number of pads in the cluster |
| int numberOfLocalMax() const | Number of local maxima |
| int firstPad() const | First-pad index |
| float amplitudeSum() const | Total ADC amplitude sum |
| float amplitude2Sum() const | Sum of squared ADC amplitudes |
| float rms2() const | Stored square RMS |
| float rms2Calc() const | Computed square RMS from sums |
| void updateAmplitude(float) | Accumulate a pad ADC value |
| void increaseNumberOfPads() | Increment pad count |
| void increaseNumberOfLocalMax() | Increment local-maxima count |
| void setFirstPad(int) | Set first-pad index |
| void setMinimumAmplitudeOfLocalMax(float) | Set local-max amplitude threshold |

\section strichcluster_related Related Classes
\ref page_strichpixel "StRichPixel" — individual pad contributing to this cluster. \n
\ref page_strichhit "StRichHit" — reconstructed hit derived from this cluster.
*/
